        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nightmare Tides</i> is a <strong>Survivors-like survival game</strong>—no tedious deck-building required, focusing on &quot;elemental skill progression + multi-map survival challenges&quot;:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong>: Defeat monsters to gain XP and level up. Upgrade each of the five elements (Metal, Wood, Water, Fire, Earth) to Level 2 to unlock powerful skills (Metal = Lightning AoE, Wood = Continuous Heal, Water = Wave AoE, Fire = Tracking Fire Tornado, Earth = Black Hole Devour). Mix and match skills to build your survival playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maps &amp; Experience</strong>: 4 distinct maps (Basin/Island/Snowfield/Earth). Basin and Earth maps feature random weather (rain, lightning); each map has unique difficulty + diverse enemies (humanoids, zombie dogs, venomous spiders, octopus monsters) for varied runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win Condition</strong>: Survive until Wave 20 to unlock the level’s exclusive victory card.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066140/extras/6a60bee5de710622a92d609565d87bf5.avif?t=1767536733\" width=920 height=430 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066140/extras/de2633022712c0c11fc26d1a9c5054a5.avif?t=1767536733\" width=1560 height=838 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066140/extras/f940eeeb6cf03671bbcc674e064f5e4b.avif?t=1767536733\" width=1091 height=722 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066140/extras/f28d8baf1b42e7e87c0232048f9956b1.avif?t=1767536733\" width=1334 height=632 /></sp